v 3
d connectedness. VAR-type, TVP-VAR and DCC-GARCH connectedness measures
d
d Estimates the connectedness measures of Diebold and Yilmaz (2009, 2012) from static
d and rolling-window VARs, quantile and LAD VARs, LASSO, ridge and elastic-net VARs and the TVP-VAR connectedness measures of Antonakakis,
d Chatziantoniou and Gabauer (2020), with corrected total, pairwise and influence
d indices, frequency connectedness (Barunik and Krehlik 2018), joint and extended
d joint connectedness, R2 decomposed and model-free connectedness, DCC-GARCH
d volatility connectedness (Gabauer 2020), asymmetric
d (positive and negative) connectedness, group measures
d (aggregated, conditional, inclusive, exclusive, internal, external), network plots,
d and portfolio and hedging strategies (minimum connectedness, multivariate hedging,
d risk-parity, bivariate portfolios, hedge ratios). Port of the ConnectednessApproach R package by David Gabauer (GPL-3).
d Includes 18 datasets from published applications.
d
d Requires: Stata 16.1 or newer
d Author: Nikolaos Antonakakis, University of Nicosia
d Support: antonakakis.n@unic.ac.cy
d Distribution-Date: 20261023
d License: GPL-3
